[A,README.md,1] # defaults-deep [![NPM version](https://badge.fury.io/js/defaults-deep.svg)](http://badge.fury.io/js/defaults-deep)
[A,README.md,2] 
[A,README.md,3] > Like `extend` but recursively copies only the missing properties/values to the target object.
[A,README.md,4] 
[A,README.md,5] ## Related
[A,README.md,6] 
[A,README.md,7]  - [object.defaults](https://github.com/jonschlinkert/object.defaults)
[A,README.md,8]  - [object.filter](https://github.com/jonschlinkert/object.filter)
[A,README.md,9]  - [object.map](https://github.com/jonschlinkert/object.map)
[A,README.md,10]  - [object.mixin](https://github.com/jonschlinkert/object.mixin)
[A,README.md,11]  - [object.omit](https://github.com/jonschlinkert/object.omit)
[A,README.md,12]  - [object.pick](https://github.com/jonschlinkert/object.pick)
[A,README.md,13]  - [object.reduce](https://github.com/jonschlinkert/object.reduce)
[A,README.md,14] 
[A,README.md,15] 
[A,README.md,16] ## Usage
[A,README.md,17] 
[A,README.md,18] ```js
[A,README.md,19] var defaults = require('defaults-deep');
[A,README.md,20] 
[A,README.md,21] defaults({a: {one: 'one'}}, {a: {two: 'two'}})
[A,README.md,22] //=> {a: {one: 'one', two: 'two'}};
[A,README.md,23] ```
[A,README.md,24] 
[A,README.md,25] ## Install
[A,README.md,26] #### Install with [npm](npmjs.org)
[A,README.md,27] 
[A,README.md,28] ```bash
[A,README.md,29] npm i defaults-deep --save
[A,README.md,30] ```
[A,README.md,31] #### Install with [bower](https://github.com/bower/bower)
[A,README.md,32] 
[A,README.md,33] ```bash
[A,README.md,34] bower install defaults-deep --save
[A,README.md,35] ```
[A,README.md,36] 
[A,README.md,37] ## Run tests
[A,README.md,38] 
[A,README.md,39] ```bash
[A,README.md,40] npm test
[A,README.md,41] ```
[A,README.md,42] 
